WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.340
Watch out! Do you want to get hit?

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:15.040
I've been thinking of a heroine that would leave a mark in comic history.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.280
I haven't slept for over ten days.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:20.550
My willpower and stamina are at the limit.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.190
What is happening?

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:26.090
Has my imagination run dry?

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.060
I don't care who.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:33.630
Just give me a hint to write that heroine!

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.300
Hop, hop, hop.

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.910
What?

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:54.150
Hop, hop, hop.

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:04.030
That's it!
That's the model I should draw!

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:07.300
It's the birth of a heroine that will

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:11.200
create new frontiers in the comic world!

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:21.580
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:32.090
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:48.240
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:55.310
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:01:55.780 --> 00:02:01.950
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:09.660
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:14.400
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:18.200
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:21.470
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:27.280
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:31.580
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:34.820
<i>I want to protect my loved one</i>

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:41.020
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:43.660
Rub the Tail!

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:46.130
"Rub the Tail!"
Rub the Tail!

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:47.030
Rub the Tail!

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:53.740
You want to know my true self, right?

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:57.470
This is in the way, isn't it?

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:02.680
It really is embarrassing when the time comes.

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:06.850
But today I'm not going to quit halfway.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.490
Please don't move.

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:14.120
You can't move.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.760
It hasn't changed at all!

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:21.730
Why?

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:24.070
Could it be...?

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:27.170
Oh, it's you, Karina.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:31.010
A chicken-shaped magic tool?
What's that?

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:34.080
Anyway. Find it. Now. Capture.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.180
What?

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:38.880
Emits. Strong.
Electric shock. So. Immediately.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:43.220
I can't hear you very well.
Where are you?

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.720
My job forbids me to say.

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:48.060
- I'll call again.
- Karina...

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:53.760
Stay vigilant, Keita Kawahira.

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:59.600
I don't get it... Chicken?

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:05.370
What are you doing?

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:08.410
So you saw it.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.580
What's wrong?

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.350
Calm down.

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:15.150
Did something happen to your tail?

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:21.090
Teleport.

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:25.530
You again?

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.700
Wait, listen to me first!

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:30.130
Go on a diet

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:33.570
All right.
I guess I'll start from this.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:38.340
One, two...

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:49.020
Keita!

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:51.720
I came to play.

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.960
You sure are free.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.560
But nothing's interesting at school.

00:04:57.030 --> 00:05:00.400
It's fine. I came to see you.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:04.000
Anyway, look. It's different, right?

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:05.830
What's different?

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:09.100
It's different. Look carefully!

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:11.410
It's four grams lighter.

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.210
What? Four grams?

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:14.780
I won't notice that.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:18.280
But it's so much thinner.
Can't you see?

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:19.180
Not at all.

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:21.150
Unbelievable!

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:24.520
Kawahira? Is Keita Kawahira here?

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:30.130
I've been looking for you.

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:32.130
Who are you?

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:34.560
Naoki Kawarazaki of class 3-B.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:40.140
The fighting geek who will not submit to pressure or prejudice.

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:47.340
You're a strong Inukami User, so I want you to find someone.

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:48.680
Find someone?

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:50.450
I'll pay you.

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:53.180
Take this.

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:59.360
They're rare fan comics from a certain booth

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:03.660
that sold out fast and will make fans drool.

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:06.430
And the calling card signed by the author too.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:10.430
I rode the first train there to buy these.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:12.070
And this!

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:17.070
This looks great, but I'm not into this hobby.

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:21.380
But it'd sell well on an auction site.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:23.110
Oh really?

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:25.410
Putting that aside.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:27.380
Who am I supposed to find?

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:29.390
A girl that looks just like her.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:51.970
One, two. One, two.

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:54.180
What's he doing?

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.140
No idea.

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:59.050
Oh, my Muse. Mon amour!

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:00.120
Evil Fire.

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:07.790
I see. You want Yoko as a model for your main character.

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:09.760
What made you so interested?

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:11.260
The tail.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:12.930
Tail?

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:17.600
Look! It's so brilliant and beautiful!

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:20.400
It's a world treasure.

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:22.670
What is he saying?

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.140
He's complimenting your tail.

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:26.480
Oh, really?

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:28.980
Those who can't understand its beauty

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:31.880
have no right to speak of beauty nor live.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:37.920
I am so moved by her tail that looks like a raccoon's tail!

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.120
Raccoon.

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:41.560
What?

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:45.930
That fat tail triggers my creative impulses.

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:50.570
Please be the heroine of my comic, "Transforming Raccoon Girl"!

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:51.470
Raccoon.

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:54.970
Raccoon. Raccoon...

00:07:55.270 --> 00:07:55.870
Oh, no.

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:57.340
Huh?

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:02.310
I don't care.

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:06.320
My feelings didn't reach her.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.920
Well, that's how it is.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.220
Wait!

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:12.890
I'm asking you to do this job again.

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:16.830
The Kawarazaki family has flourished for generations.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:20.830
You could say those mountains are owned by me.

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:28.770
Kawarazaki is really sorry for what he did.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:31.870
I don't like him. He's kind of scary.

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:33.610
Don't say that.

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:36.550
He really wants to apologize to you.

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:40.450
He called me a raccoon.
I'll never forgive him.

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:45.890
This tail will go on a diet and I will not let anybody call me a raccoon.

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:46.990
Diet?

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:51.030
You prefer girls with a slim tail too, right?

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:55.030
The magazine said all men are like that.

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:56.300
Look.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:00.570
Yoko. This is wrong.

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:03.210
Keita?

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:08.910
A forced diet is unhealthy.
You're fine how you are.

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:10.080
Really?

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:12.080
You're so kind!

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:15.980
So, please go see Kawarazaki.

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:18.220
It will clear up the misunderstanding.

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:19.920
What are you trying to say?

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:25.760
I mean, he's rich and generous, so he's not a bad person.

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:28.630
If you talk with him, you'll understand.

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:32.200
How suspicious.
You're hiding something.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:34.640
No, I'm not hiding anything.

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:37.610
What are you hiding?
Tell me the truth.

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:39.510
Tell me!

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:44.350
Well, I said he'd get a date with you.

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:48.050
For how much?

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:50.720
How much did you sell me for?

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:53.160
One week's bread for lunch.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:55.390
That's too cheap!

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:59.860
It hurts! Rope, rope break!

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.130
My bones!

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:05.430
Umm, sorry to interrupt...

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:10.610
What is it, traveling cat?

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:12.610
Tomekichi, you're so cute.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:16.210
I see. Since you're looking for Buddha statues,

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:18.080
you're into costumes now?

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:19.780
That's not it.

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:22.180
I'm being pursued right now.

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:24.520
It's here!

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:30.430
It's fast.

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:33.300
It's useless. Please run away!

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:37.030
Mr. Keita, Miss Yoko.

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:45.810
"Inukami!"

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:49.040
Oh no, I was too late!

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:53.980
It's so fluttery.

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:55.450
Hey, what's going on?

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:57.820
That thing's to blame.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:01.760
Buddha-doodle-do. Great-a-doodle-do.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.560
That's enough.

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:06.160
What the heck is that?

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:11.470
I don't know. I found it in an old barn while looking for a Buddha.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:14.270
It's been following me ever since.

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:18.310
Mr. Chicken, come.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.110
Look, it's calm.

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:26.650
What's this?

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:31.790
Is this the chicken magic tool
Karina mentioned?

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:35.320
I'll call him just in case.

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:37.060
Karina...

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:38.260
I'm away. Be brief.

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:43.530
It's Keita. I found a wooden chicken with a skull and moon.

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:48.000
It's probably the one you said.
Please come get it.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:52.710
It's hard to move in this!

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:56.010
How do you take this off?

00:11:56.010 --> 00:11:57.380
You can't.

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:59.310
What? No way!

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:04.520
It's impossible.
It's a complete costume.

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:06.620
You mean it's permanent?

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:10.960
Don't be embarrassed.

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:13.830
I've shown you something unsightly.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:17.300
So we can return to normal.
Don't scare me.

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:19.430
The costumes last for two hours.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:22.140
But if the chicken is nearby...

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:28.410
It never ends because it keeps following me!

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:32.450
I hope Karina comes soon.

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:33.680
Yeah.

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:39.520
What's wrong, Mr. Chicken?

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:51.930
My Muse. Mon amour, Yoko.
I have come to pick you up!

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:55.340
How long have I waited for this day?

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:57.610
Let us enjoy it together!

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:07.020
Oh, no!

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:18.730
Cat ears on a cat.

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:21.730
What did I ever do?

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.000
Why am I like this?

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:26.100
This is...

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:30.670
I see. You read my mind.

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:31.970
Good job!

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:34.710
You. What grudge do you have with me?

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:36.780
I have no grudge with you.

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:40.520
It's a perfect Magical Girl Asoko!

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:42.550
How beautiful.

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:45.790
My comrade Doodly-doo, you are the best!

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:50.560
Doodly-doo my butt!
Give the chicken back!

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:55.200
I'll go there, you go there.
Let's get him!

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:56.330
Okay.

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:00.970
No!

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:04.070
Welcome, master.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.580
500 yen for a bunch, master.

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:09.080
Oh no, this is bad.

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:12.080
In 2 hours, this city will...

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:19.090
It'll turn into true hell.

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:23.460
It's very noisy.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:24.390
What is it?

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:28.130
That person...

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:39.210
Stop it with the annoying act!

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:42.810
I knew it, you're Ruriko Saffron.

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:44.350
I've read your works.

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:49.120
I would like to chat more, but I have to hurry. Excuse me.

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:52.290
Who's Saffron?

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:53.360
I don't know.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:14:59.260
Oh, my.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:01.800
New clothes!

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:07.040
Why am I the only one like this?

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:09.040
Everyone!

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:12.740
Yoko.

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:14.480
Such cute clothes.

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:16.750
It's the real Asoko.

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:19.110
I don't want a mini skirt!

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:28.120
My nerves will be destroyed before the world ends.

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:30.130
Where are you, Kawarazaki?

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:32.760
You again, Keita Kawahira!

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:36.630
What? You got a problem with this look?

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:38.330
Obviously.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:43.670
Why? Is a guy wearing cat ears and a women's swimsuit illegal?

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:47.080
No, it's about good conscience...

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:50.580
This is my hobby.

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:52.480
I'm in a hurry.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:54.550
That's...

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:04.730
We have to capture that guy and the chicken to turn back.

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:08.100
We can't leave a magic tool alone.
We'll cooperate.

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:09.660
Seal its power!

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:11.330
With pleasure, master.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.840
Wait for me!

00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:24.380
You're desperate, Kawahira.

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:26.350
Quiet! Give me the chicken!

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:32.220
Doodly-doo and I just want to make the world more fun.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:35.120
Doodly-doo will be happier too.

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:40.730
Do you like making people look like this?

00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:57.480
What's going on?

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:11.630
Keita, the time!

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:15.900
Kawarazaki, it's time to end this.

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:20.170
I swear in the name of fighting geeks,
I will not lose!

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:08.120
You did well, Keita Kawahira.

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:12.520
You're not bad either.
I'm amazed.

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:17.060
A fighting geek is fated to keep fighting.

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:19.630
We shall meet again. Farewell!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:23.360
Yoko.

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:28.200
I wish you would've called me big brother!

00:18:32.070 --> 00:18:33.580
Keita.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:42.980
I'll take this as a viewing fee.

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:47.090
Keita.

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:48.560
Behind you.

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:54.330
You're so persistent.
I said this is my hobby!

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:59.630
Nice hobby, Keita Kawahira. Let's go.

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:00.970
Okay.

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:04.010
Please let him go.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:13.750
It's a pervert.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.750
- A pervert.
- Pervert?

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:17.290
I'm no pervert!

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:19.820
Then are you his friend?

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:24.860
Mr. Karina! Thank you for your work.

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:29.960
Keita, Mr. Chicken is...

00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:31.170
What's wrong?

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:34.370
It ran out of spiritual powers.

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:40.880
Karina, is that...

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:44.150
I talked about this on the phone.

00:19:44.150 --> 00:19:47.880
A magic tool made by the ancient mage, Sekidousai.

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:49.380
Sekidousai?

00:19:50.150 --> 00:19:53.390
A fearsome mage with incredible power.

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:57.630
It reads the mind of those with strong desires.

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.930
Then realizes the form they desire.

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:02.230
Why make such a thing?

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:04.130
I don't know.

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:11.510
But there are many more unreasonable magic tools made by Sekidousai.

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:15.780
I am searching for them.

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:26.590
Will that happen to us too?

00:20:26.590 --> 00:20:28.490
Let's hurry back.

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:31.090
Bye, Mr. Pervert.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:34.730
I am...

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:37.700
I am no pervert!

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:00.760
Yoko.

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:01.860
What?

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:04.060
You've worked hard.

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:06.560
It's a lot thinner now.

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:11.770
Was that sarcasm?
I was worried since it got fatter.

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:13.000
Really?

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:14.740
You're so dull!

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:19.410
Why?

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:24.980
Transforming Raccoon Girl

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:43.100
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:48.470
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:53.610
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:58.850
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:02.080
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:02.080 --> 00:22:04.620
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:07.320
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.320 --> 00:22:10.790
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:13.590
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.590 --> 00:22:16.360
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.360 --> 00:22:21.570
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:24.070
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:26.810
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:32.850
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.280 --> 00:22:35.650
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Fight</i>

00:22:35.650 --> 00:22:38.350
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:41.990
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:54.000
Inukami!

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:54.970
See you!

00:22:55.070 --> 00:22:56.100
Next episode preview

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:59.070
In Buddhism, there are 108 worldly desires.

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:02.940
Hence, 108 prayer beads and New Year bell strikes.

00:23:03.380 --> 00:23:07.480
Each time the bell is struck, one desire disappears.

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:12.890
Since the bell is struck every year,
I guess desires come back quickly.

00:23:12.890 --> 00:23:14.860
It is endless...

